   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Kèo parle de ses projets.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ມື້ອື່ນເຈົ້າຈະເຮັດຫຍັງ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແກ້ວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຂ້ອຍຈະໄປຫຼິ້ນບານກັບໝູ່</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ແລ້ວອາທິດໜ້າເດ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແກ້ວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຈະໄປທ່ຽວຫຼວງພະບາງ</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ອິດສາແທ້!</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Romanisation (mots nouveaux)</summary><p><span class=\"rom\">Mʉ̂ʉ-ʉ̀ʉn jâo já hēt nyǎng?</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Khɔ̂ɔy já pǎy lîn bǎan káp mùu.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Lɛ̏ɛw ǎa-thīt-nâa dě?</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Já pǎy thīaw lǔang-phā-báang.</span><br><span class=\"rom\">Ít-sǎa thɛ̏ɛ!</span></p></details><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Clara</b> — Demain, tu vas faire quoi ?<br><b>Kèo</b> — Je vais jouer au foot avec des amis.<br><b>Clara</b> — Et la semaine prochaine ?<br><b>Kèo</b> — Je vais visiter Luang Prabang.<br><b>Clara</b> — Je suis jalouse !</p></details>"
